 "notes": [
  "Audit of Metro vs 128 catalogue items from names/units/sizes only (no price data seen). Method: ran the repo's matchProduct per item over all 26,448 Metro Hammer rows, then reviewed every product it would accept.",
  "1299 product ids excluded: non-grocery/prepared junk matched on a word (gum, tarts, lozenges, sausages, pizza, tea, sauces, 'butter' lettuce, veal 'milk fed'), wrong pack size, or wrong variant (organic, plant-based, light, flavoured, 1%/2%/3.8%/6% milk mixups, omega-3/free-run eggs, shredded/sliced cheese, crumbled feta, flavoured yogurt, premium/odd cuts), and products with no size where size is required.",
  "377 assignments across 106 items: only products I judged an exact name+size fit; brands left open. Each came out of the repo matcher's own candidate set.",
  "Not verified (no prices): per-kg produce with blank size or 'sold individually' (bananas, gala/honeycrisp/granny apples, navel oranges, pears, grapes, broccoli, cabbage, sweet potato, zucchini, ginger). Metro may list these per lb or per unit. Per-unit ('1un'/sold individually) listings for per-kg items were excluded; blank-size ones were left alone (not excluded, not assigned).",
  "Matcher misses that cannot be fixed by assignment (matcher rejects 'N un - Xg' size text): Metro pita 6 un-400g (Breadko Alwatan white/whole wheat), English muffins 6 un-360g/340g, Selection and Dempster's plain bagels 6 un-510g/450g. Roma and vine tomatoes: only 'Cluster Tomatoes 4 lb' (no 'vine'/'roma' word), nothing assigned.",
  "No good Metro match found for: soy milk 1.89 L (all organic/vanilla), plain Greek yogurt 500 g (Oikos 0% has no size; 650 g/750 g/907 g others), 4 kg sugar, croissants x6, dinner rolls x12, pita (see above).",
  "Judgment calls: Selection/Hunt's etc. 'tomato sauce' excluded for pasta-sauce item; shredded mozzarella, Lactantia 'cooking cream', crunchy/light peanut butter, 1% to 6% milk variants, organic anything, Plant-based butter all excluded as different variants. Size tolerance +-15% as in matcher (e.g. 425 g strawberries, 400 g margarine, 1.75 L plant milk, 500 g rye/ricotta 454 g kept)."
 ]
